//- views/about.pug — About page
extends layout

block content
  .page-header
    .container
      h1 About Community Languages
      p Learn about our mission to preserve and share community languages

  section.section
    .container
      .about-section
        .about-text
          h2 🌍 Why Community Languages Matter
          p Community languages are the languages spoken by minority or migrant communities within a larger society. They carry centuries of culture, identity, and heritage.
          p Many community languages are at risk of being lost as younger generations shift to dominant languages. Our platform aims to reverse this trend by making language learning accessible and community-driven.
        .about-card
          .card-icon 📖
          h3 Over 7,000 Languages
          p There are over 7,000 languages spoken worldwide, and many are endangered. Every language lost is a piece of human heritage gone forever.

      .about-section
        .about-text
          h2 🎓 For Learners
          p Whether you want to reconnect with your heritage language, learn a friend's mother tongue, or explore a new culture, our platform provides free, community-created lessons.
          p Browse lessons by language, difficulty, or category. Track your progress, take quizzes, and engage with teachers and fellow learners in our community forum.
        .about-card
          .card-icon 🤝
          h3 Learn from Native Speakers
          p Our teachers are community members who share their language knowledge freely, creating an authentic learning experience.

      .about-section
        .about-text
          h2 📚 For Teachers
          p Share your language with the world. Create lessons, vocabulary lists, and quizzes. Help preserve your community language while building connections with eager learners.
          p As a teacher, you earn points for your contributions and can see the impact of your work through learner progress and engagement.
        .about-card
          .card-icon ⭐
          h3 Make a Difference
          p Every lesson you create helps preserve a language and empowers learners to connect with new communities.

  section.section(style="background: var(--bg-white);")
    .container
      .section-header
        h2 Our Values
        p Built on principles of respect, accessibility, and community
      .card-grid
        .card.feature-card
          .feature-icon 🔒
          h3 Privacy and Safety
          p We protect user data and create a safe space for language learning. No financial transactions, just mutual benefit.
        .card.feature-card
          .feature-icon ♿
          h3 Accessibility
          p Our platform is designed to be usable by everyone, regardless of technical ability or disability.
        .card.feature-card
          .feature-icon 🌈
          h3 Cultural Sensitivity
          p We respect all languages and cultures equally. Our community guidelines promote respectful interaction.
        .card.feature-card
          .feature-icon 💚
          h3 Non-Commercial
          p This platform is built on mutual benefit, not profit. Knowledge is shared freely for the good of the community.
